Then I went into a huge park.
I followed the wide paths first.
Many other people went for a walk there.
But I just walked for many kilometres.
I walked past statues and old palaces.
The buildings looked incredibly beautiful.
I stopped often.
I looked at everything very closely.
After that I walked on.
I walked in among the tall trees.
I did not see any other people there anymore.
Then I also turned onto the small side paths.
I just kept strolling further.
I felt like I was in a big forest.
Sofia, I haven't hiked this much in a long time!
